**Input:**
```json
{
  "items": [
    {"commentary_id": "...", "text": "..."},
    ...
  ],
  "openai_api_key": "..."
}
```

**Output:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "results": [...],
  "summary": {"total": N, "cached": X, "generated": Y}
}
```

